# Underworld Breach: "Each nonland card in your graveyard has escape." Lindblum, Industrial Regency is a land card in the
# graveyard - it has only its normal characteristics there (CR 715.4) - so its Adventure, the instant Mage Siege, is not
# cast by escape, though {2}{R} is untapped and three other cards could be exiled. Faithless Looting, a nonland card, is
# escaped for {R} and the three others - the positive control.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mountain
Faithless Looting
Black Lotus
Underworld Breach
Mox Emerald
Mox Sapphire
Mox Ruby
Lindblum, Industrial Regency
Island
Island x15

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mountain.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Mountain.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Faithless Looting.Cast
Bot1.Choose(Lindblum, Industrial Regency; Island)
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Red)
Bot1.Hand.Underworld Breach.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
! Bot1.Graveyard.Lindblum, Industrial Regency.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Graveyard.Faithless Looting.Cast(Ability: Escape)
Bot1.Choose(Pay mana)
Bot1.Choose(Black Lotus; Lindblum, Industrial Regency; Island)
Bot1.Choose(Island; Island)

[Expect]
Turn = 1
Exile = Black Lotus; Island; Lindblum, Industrial Regency
Bot1.Graveyard = Faithless Looting; Island; Island
